.TH SONDA 1 "@DATE@" "sonda @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sonda \- network quality of experience probe
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sonda
.I command
.RI [ args ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sonda
is an experimental network probe.
It measures STUN, DNS over UDP, DNS over HTTPS, and HTTPS, and
stores the raw results in a local spool.
It then extracts quality of experience (QoE) metrics from the spool
into daily Parquet files for later analysis.
.PP
The Debian package installs a systemd timer that runs
.B sonda scan
five minutes after the previous scan finishes.
Each scan runs the steps listed in
.IR /etc/sonda/scan/default.yml :
the measurements, then the metrics extraction and loading.
A second timer runs
.B sonda spool gc
every hour to remove old spool entries.
.PP
This tool is under active development and its interface may change.
For the full list of commands and per\-command help, run:
.PP
.RS 4
.B sonda \-\-help
.br
.BI "sonda " command " \-\-help"
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sonda/config.toml
Settings for the
.B sonda
commands, such as the maximum age of spool entries.
The commented\-out values are the defaults.
.TP
.I /etc/sonda/scan/default.yml
Steps executed by the periodic scan.
.TP
.I /var/spool/sonda/
Spool with one directory per measurement, containing the request,
stdout, stderr, and exit code.
The spool garbage collection removes entries older than six hours
by default.
Members of the
.B _sonda
group can read it.
.TP
.I /var/lib/sonda/metrics/
Daily QoE metrics, written as
.IR qoe/YYYY/MM/DD/YYYY\-MM\-DD.parquet .
Nothing removes these files.
Members of the
.B _sonda
group can read them.
.TP
.I /run/sonda/inetd\-ptnop.sock
Socket served by
.BR sonda\-inetd\-ptnop ,
which accepts ptnop measurement requests.
Members of the
.B _sonda
group can connect to it.
.TP
.I /usr/libexec/sonda/
The
.B sonda
executable and its plugins.
.TP
.I /usr/share/sonda/plugins/
Plugin descriptions shown by
.BR "sonda \-\-help" .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SONDA_EXEC_PATH
Directory containing the executable and its plugins
(default:
.IR /usr/libexec/sonda ).
.TP
.B SONDA_SHARE_PATH
Directory containing the plugin descriptions
(default:
.IR /usr/share/sonda ).
